<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Feb 06 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Feb 06 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.003 trillion in the week to February 06 from $1.000 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     70.62		54.63</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     47.84		28.78</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  933.27	     945.54</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    224.36	     218.01</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	726.90	     743.06</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    277.00	     257.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
